// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Guided chronic-disease interviews (#114).
//
// Every scale leads with NOT_ASSESSED, following TobaccoUseStatus above. These records are saved
// on every tab change while a volunteer is still working through the interview, so most reads see
// a half-answered row. Without a distinct "not yet asked", an unasked question is indistinguishable
// from an answer of "no" -- and the generated note would state that a patient denied a symptom
// nobody mentioned.
//
// The vocabularies are declared once in packages/db/src/{clinical-vocabulary,hypertension-interview}.ts
// and mirrored here. hypertension-schema.spec.ts fails if the two drift.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

